  "dct_description_sm": [
    "DNA data were collected to assess eukaryotic, archaeal and bacterial diversity in Lake Mackenzie, a seasonal ice-dammed lake (stamukhi lake).  This data set was obtained to determine the origins and dynamics of microbial communities in the stamukhi zone, and the implications for inshore carbon processing of riverine inputs in a changing climate."
